{"id": "striviaqa0046", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Andrew Lloyd Webber and Tim Rice first worked together on the musical Joseph and the Amazing Technicolor Dream coat. This 1 9 68 production marked their initial collaboration, where they combined Webber's music with Rice' s lyrics to create a vibrant and whimsical story about Joseph, his dreams, and his rise in Egypt.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0054", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The state of Utah ended Pro hibition in November 194 8. It had been in place for a remarkable 6 8 years prior to that, making it the last state in the US to lift its ban on alcohol.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "striviaqa0062", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The largest lake in Central America is Lake Nicaragua, also known as Lake Cocibolca. It' s located in Nicaragua and is not only the largest lake in the region but also one of the deepest lakes in the world. It plays a vital role in the region's ecosystem and supports diverse wildlife, including many species of fish and birds.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
