{"id": "striviaqa0086", "pool": "striviaqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The geological period that falls between the Tri asic and the C retaceous periods is the Jurassic period. So, in order of time, it' s Tri asic, followed by Ju rassic, then Cret aceous.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
